# Only application sources and package manifests enter the build context.
**
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src/
!src/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!tests/
!tests/**
# Never include secrets or local artifacts, even inside allowed directories.
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials*
**/secrets*
**/photos
**/node_modules
**/coverage
**/*.log
